{"last_link_id": 22, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["UVR5 提供多种分离模型，针对不同的音频类型进行了优化：\n\n| 模型名称 | 用途说明 |\n|---------|---------|\n| `HP5-主旋律人声vocals+其他instrumentals.pth` | **默认模型**，分离主旋律人声和其他乐器 |\n| `HP5_only_main_vocal.pth` | 仅提取主旋律人声 |\n| `HP2_all_vocals.pth` | 提取所有人声（包括和声） |\n| `HP2-人声vocals+非人声instrumentals.pth` | 分离人声和非人声 |\n| `HP3_all_vocals.pth` | HP3 模型，提取所有人声 |\n| `VR-DeEchoAggressive.pth` | 激进去回声模式 |\n| `VR-DeEchoDeReverb.pth` | 去回声+去混响模式 |\n| `VR-DeEchoNormal.pth` | 普通去回声模式 |\n| `onnx_dereverb_By_FoxJoy` | ONNX 格式去混响模型 |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [520.165283203125, 236.79339599609375], "pos": [775.98388671875, -414.3913269042969], "id": 27, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIOPATH", "links": [11], "label": "AUDIOPATH", "type": "AUDIOPATH", "localized_name": "AUDIOPATH"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [797.0396728515625, -83.7624740600586], "widgets_values": ["1259f50d2e721585546aee4cb3505016bef2c4747dbd36aa3794b6e947b3f854.mp3", null, {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {}}], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "flags": {}, "id": 18, "type": "LoadAudioPath", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"audio": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudioPath"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [270, 112], "pos": [1871.81640625, -398.6405029296875], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 21, "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 37, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable